# The scripts/ folder (modbus_write_coil.py, start-pinggy-tcp.sh) is
# attacker/operator tooling meant to run on a machine you control during a
# live demo — it is not part of the deployed OT simulator and is never
# invoked by app.py. Keeping it out of the Docker image is just hygiene;
# nothing in the app calls it, so its presence/absence has no effect on
# how the service behaves.
screenshots/
scripts/
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
